{'symbol': 'WTW', 'date': '2022-08-21 23:00:00', 'title': 'WTW APPOINTS SEAN DEEHAN AS LEADER OF HONG KONG AND MACAU', 'text': "HONG KONG, AUG. 21, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- WTW (NASDAQ: WTW), A LEADING GLOBAL ADVISORY, BROKING AND SOLUTIONS COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF SEAN DEEHAN AS LEADER FOR HONG KONG AND MACAU, EFFECTIVE 1 SEPTEMBER 2022. SEAN WILL ALSO CONTINUE IN HIS CURRENT POSITION AS HONG KONG MARKET LEADER FOR WTW'S INSURANCE CONSULTING & TECHNOLOGY (ICT) BUSINESS."}